  "coverImage": "https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/datasette-vega.webp",
  "readTime": 1,
  "content": "<p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/datasette-vega/releases/tag/0.7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">datasette-vega 0.7</a></p>\n<p>A new release of Datasette's longest untouched plugin, for rendering charts (using <a href=\"https://vega.github.io/vega-lite/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Vega-Lite</a>) against data in a table or custom query. The last release was in July 2018!</p>\n<p>I finally bumped it for compatibility with the latest Datasette alphas, plus some cosmetic tweaks to make it work better with <a href=\"https://lite.datasette.io/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Datasette Lite</a>.</p>\n<p>(Datasette Lite just gained the ability to run JavaScript plugins like this! I'll write more about that soon.)</p>\n<p>Since it works with Datasette Lite, the live demo in the README now <a href=\"https://lite.datasette.io/?install=datasette-vega&amp;csv=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Ffivethirtyeight%2Fdata%2Fmaster%2Fairline-safety%2Fairline-safety.csv#/data/airline-safety?_size=max#g.mark=bar&amp;g.x_column=airline&amp;g.x_type=ordinal&amp;g.y_column=fatalities_00_14&amp;g.y_type=quantitative\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">links to this demo on Datasette Lite</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt='Screenshot of a charting tool. A panel headed \"Charting options\" has radio buttons for \"Bar\" (selected), \"Line\" and \"Scatter\". Below are select menus: \"X column\" set to \"airline\" with \"Type\" set to \"Label\", and \"Y column\" set to \"fatalities_00_14\" with \"Type\" set to \"Numeric\". A \"Swap X and Y\" button sits beneath those, followed by \"Color\" and \"Size\" menus both set to \"-- none --\". Underneath the panel is a blue bar chart with airline names along the X axis and fatalities_00_14 on the Y axis, running from 0 to 550 - most airlines have no bar, a handful have bars, and Malaysia Airlines is the tallest.' loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/datasette-vega.webp\"/></p>\n<p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/datasette\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">datasette</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/visualisation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">visualisation</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/datasette-lite\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">datasette-lite</a></p>",
